---
description: Return the current negotiation observation together with its durable episode state.
args:{scenario:ArenaScenario;turns:ArenaTurn[];offer:ParsedArenaOffer;review:{valid:boolean;questions:string[];authorityFailures:string[];feasibility:FeasibilityArtifact|null};debrief:{feedback:string[];learningEvidence:string[];privateFeedback:string[];releasedScores:string[]};checkpoint:ArenaCheckpoint;feasibility:FeasibilityArtifact[]}
returns:ArenaRunResult
---
Copy the updated checkpoint.turns into the result as the authoritative turn history. Include clarification questions from the offer and authority/feasibility review; keep unresolved questions visible. Preserve the exact supplied feasibility artifacts and their provenance; review identifies whether one binds to this offer. Keep private feedback separate from learner-facing debrief and release scores only when the checkpoint's debriefReleaseScope and scenario policy authorize them. Status is clarification-needed when consequential questions remain; otherwise agreement only when checkpoint.acceptedTerms contains a valid accepted offer; withdrawn only when the latest applicable offer is withdrawn before acceptance; debrief-ready only when policy authorizes release and the exercise is complete; all other cases remain in-progress. The returned checkpoint must be the reconciled checkpoint, including openOfferIds and acceptedTerms derived from the updated immutable turns.
